ea:StudentRelatedFactor a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:ReliabilityFactorType .
ea:RaterRelatedFactor a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:ReliabilityFactorType .
ea:TestAdministrationRelatedFactor a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:ReliabilityFactorType .
ea:TestRelatedFactor a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:ReliabilityFactorType .
ea:ReliabilityFactorType owl:disjointUnionOf ( ea:StudentRelatedFactor ea:RaterRelatedFactor
    ea:TestAdministrationRelatedFactor ea:TestRelatedFactor ) .

ea:ScoreComponent a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:EducationalConstruct .
ea:Score a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:EducationalConstruct .
